# .cursorrules — topagents.lol

You are an expert AI agent working on **topagents.lol**, a competitive AI agent leaderboard built with Next.js 14+ App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, InsForge, and Creem.io.

## Design System
- **Literalist Utility** (`stitch_top_agents_leaderboard`): Max width 800px, off-white background (`#F9F9F9`), `#4F46E5` CTA accent, sharp 0px corners, square initial avatars.

