## Invariants
- `claimed_by_email` is PRIVATE. Exclude from all public endpoints.
- Rank is calculated dynamically based on `amount_cents DESC`.
- Minimum bid logic ($5 base, +$1 outbid) must be validated server-side.
- Verify Creem webhook signatures in `/api/webhooks/creem`.
